---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="About">
    <article class="wrap">
        <header class="post-header">
            <h1>About</h1>
        </header>
        <div class="prose">
            <p>
                Hi, my name is Rein. I'm a developer based in Ghent, Belgium.
                Before I wrote software, I trained as a teacher, and I still
                can't resist explaining technical things to non-technical
                people.
            </p>
            <p>
                This blog is where I distill what I learn about AI into articles
                that most people should be able to understand. All of my writing
                is done artisanally, meaning I write it myself, but I do use AI
                as an editor, to give feedback on grammar, style and structure.
            </p>
        </div>
    </article>
</Base>
